<title>USA: Corning Inc sets qtly div $0.18.</title>
<headline>Corning Inc sets qtly div $0.18.</headline>
<dateline>CORNING, N.Y. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corning Inc said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.18 per common share to be paid March 31 to shareholders of record March 3.</p>
<p>The company paid one common share of Corning Clinical Labs Inc per one Corning Inc common share for the previous dividend.</p>
